# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# SplitGasto 2026 - Cloudflare Pages Redirects (v4.4 Clean URLs)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# STRATEGY: Clean URLs — router uses /auth, /dashboard, etc.
# Each route is EXPLICIT. No wildcard /* catch-all (avoids loops).
# CF Pages serves index.html for / automatically — NO rule needed.
# CF Pages serves .html files directly if accessed with extension.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# NOTE: / → index.html is handled natively by Cloudflare Pages.
# Adding an explicit rule causes an infinite-loop error. Omitted.

